# A player with exactly 3 life can pay Terror of the Peaks' additional 3 life (CR 119.4: the life total is at least the
# payment). Bot2 at 3 casts Lightning Bolt at Terror, pays {R} and 3 life, and is at 0: the state-based action makes Bot2
# lose the game before anyone has priority (CR 704.5a), so the Bolt never resolves.

[Life]
Bot2: 3

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Show and Tell
Terror of the Peaks
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Show and Tell.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Terror of the Peaks)
Bot2.Choose()
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Terror of the Peaks)

[Expect]
Result = Bot1 won
Bot2.Life = 0
Bot2.Status = Lost
Bot1.Battlefield.Terror of the Peaks.Damage = 0
